  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">HCFC Phase-out Management Plan for Malaysia &#x2013; Stage III (Malaysia HPMP-III)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">HPMP Stage III will support in phasing out 257.67 ODP tonnes of HCFCs, enabling Malaysia to achieve the Montreal Protocol compliance goal of 100 percent reduction by 2030. This project adopts a portfolio strategy that draws from experiences and lessons learned from Stage I (2011-2016) and Stage II (2017-2024).</narrative>
  </description>
